TITLE Final ionic strength after incremental H2SO4 addition
SOLUTION 1 Pure water pH 7
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1

REACTION 1
    H2SO4 1
    0.001 0.005 0.01 0.05 0.1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -simulation true
    -state true
    -ionic_strength true
END
